0\u1eddng c\u1ea7n \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 ti\u00eau ch\u00ed sau:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JqgZdsm7loPqBqxzCUild9TVgcg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C\u00f3 \u00edt nh\u1ea5t <strong>1,000 follower<\/strong> (con s\u1ed1 n\u00e0y c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BP5adFnCpoKrOzxde7YlyjPpgIe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u00e3 livestream \u00edt nh\u1ea5t <strong>25 ph\u00fat<\/strong> trong v\u00f2ng 30 ng\u00e0y qua.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MQukdDHQdoeCnwxBetGlJQxJgBh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00f3 l\u1ecbch s\u1eed t\u1ed1t, kh\u00f4ng vi ph\u1ea1m nghi\u00eam tr\u1ecdng Ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n C\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-QHVBd5GC8o2JjlxeoSul0gbpgrb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: T\u1ea3i v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m Live Studio<\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R1zwdnzO1oa3G2xSmPzlqEqlgrm\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Truy c\u1eadp trang web ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a TikTok tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TQjXd7R9GokYfHx9VumlOnjTgPc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ebfu t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd th\u1ea5y t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn t\u1ea3i <strong>Live Studio<\/strong>. Nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea3i file c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WxRyd3y9vorlD9xyDtklJwgfgqh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>M\u1edf file v\u1eeba t\u1ea3i v\u00e0 l\u00e0m theo c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m l\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Focgdyq4SogL7zxc2TElodlPg7c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: \u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp cho bu\u1ed5i live \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean<\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-THUkdMwAHoBx5Wx3aZylVzrWgmc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>M\u1edf ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m TikTok Live Studio v\u00e0 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp b\u1eb1ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NKYOdQng0orICKx9od2lhcH5gbg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>L\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m s\u1ebd h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea1n qua c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n nh\u01b0 ki\u1ec3m tra camera, microphone v\u00e0 t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ea1ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ph\u00e1t s\u00f3ng t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Ivebd82EyoWndMxR7NWlDP6ugie\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: L\u00e0m quen giao di\u1ec7n ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a TikTok Live Studio<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Df6ldT9ymoOGiqxrBMTlQaIJgBh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Giao di\u1ec7n ch\u00ednh bao g\u1ed3m c\u00e1c khu v\u1ef1c quan tr\u1ecdng sau:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RkgwdBzBBogjZKxzxIelDadjgof\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd C\u1ea3nh (Scenes):<\/strong> N\u01a1i b\u1ea1n t\u1ea1o ra c\u00e1c layout kh\u00e1c nhau cho bu\u1ed5i live (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: c\u1ea3nh ch\u1edd, c\u1ea3nh ch\u01a1i game, c\u1ea3nh ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 webcam).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AyP1dAjamo8rMZxfDetllD5eg7f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ngu\u1ed3n ph\u00e1t (Sources):<\/strong> Trong m\u1ed7i c\u1ea3nh, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u00eam c\u00e1c ngu\u1ed3n nh\u01b0 &#8220;Camera&#8221;, &#8220;Chia s\u1ebb m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh&#8221;, &#8220;H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh&#8221;, &#8220;V\u0103n b\u1ea3n&#8221;,&#8230;<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RrcBdW6PToUPWDx2brhlL50fgse\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Th\u00f4ng tin bu\u1ed5i live:<\/strong> \u0110\u1eb7t ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1, \u1ea3nh b\u00eca, v\u00e0 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 cho bu\u1ed5i livestream.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jf8adXVUqoK1Srxu2V5l6N4ugAc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c:<\/strong> Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, xem h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0, v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kh\u00e1c c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CsyMdEHwPo3c63x7Q5Nl0fZpgAb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>N\u00fat &#8220;B\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u&#8221; (Go LIVE):<\/strong> Khi \u0111\u00e3 thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp xong, h\u00e3y nh\u1ea5n n\u00fat n\u00e0y \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c ph\u00e1t s\u00f3ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DPUXdCHv8octLLxxZC5lqIOAgFd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-XcYZdUookov4W7x93nslfAhEg1c\">5 M\u1eb9o t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c khi livestream b\u1eb1ng TikTok Live Studio<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IPNsdsTRUo9hL3xSHk6lhyqLgAf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-WpkVdR4ilo8lNZxRGrFlHUYTgTe\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;afe18d66-b94a-4f17-b713-ab892e579bbb&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;cu