v>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iuxqdc7xYoh7g0xpd7YlN0INgIe\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp c\u1ea3nh b\u00e1o (Alerts):<\/strong> C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o vui nh\u1ed9n hi\u1ec7n l\u00ean m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh m\u1ed7i khi c\u00f3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i m\u1edbi, t\u1eb7ng qu\u00e0, ho\u1eb7c chia s\u1ebb livestream \u0111\u1ec3 ghi nh\u1eadn v\u00e0 khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch h\u1ecd.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QPvHdUyDko8o7yxkOMwl8B7ggwe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00ednh n\u0103ng chia s\u1ebb m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh:<\/strong> Tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn, ch\u01a1i game, ho\u1eb7c tr\u00ecnh chi\u1ebfu slide b\u00e0i gi\u1ea3ng. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch cung c\u1ea5p gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o m\u00e0 livestream tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OASkdPgs5oAl2NxSj4Fl9I4YgCh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ea1o c\u00e1c khung h\u00ecnh (Overlays) chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p:<\/strong> Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u00e1c khung \u0111\u1ed3 h\u1ecda c\u00f3 ch\u1ee9a logo, th\u00f4ng tin m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i ho\u1eb7c th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p k\u00eau g\u1ecdi h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng t\u00ednh th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SWEgdXX4hoV83Ox3jaDlxKdigwd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c mini-game t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c:<\/strong> S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00ednh n\u0103ng th\u00eam v\u0103n b\u1ea3n v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o ra c\u00e1c mini-game nh\u01b0 &#8220;\u0110u\u1ed5i h\u00ecnh b\u1eaft ch\u1eef&#8221; ho\u1eb7c &#8220;B\u1ed1c th\u0103m may m\u1eafn&#8221; ngay tr\u00ean m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FIfqdoctpoNMCVxQPsKlN8rSg5f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p nhi\u1ec1u g\u00f3c quay:<\/strong> N\u1ebfu c\u00f3 th\u1ec3, h\u00e3y s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nhi\u1ec1u camera \u0111\u1ec3 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i gi\u1eefa c\u00e1c g\u00f3c quay (to\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh, c\u1eadn c\u1ea3nh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m,&#8230;) l\u00e0m cho bu\u1ed5i live th\u00eam ph\u1ea7n sinh \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<blockquote class=\" old-record-id-PV7kdmvr9oyWVIxluT7lUbqQg1f\" data-type=\"quote_container\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NtHndzOzVoB4WJxYcN7l9bY2gyu\">Vi\u1ec7c thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp m\u1ed9t bu\u1ed5i livestream chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb v\u00e0 k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kh\u00e1 ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p. \u0110\u1ec3 ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao nh\u1ea5t, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham kh\u1ea3o <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/dich-vu\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 cho thu\u00ea studio v\u00e0 host livestream<\/a><\/strong> chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<\/blockquote>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HSUBdqJs0oIYiGxUAtylGyaUgYe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok Live Studio th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 thay \u0111\u1ed5i cu\u1ed9c ch\u01a1i, gi\u00fap c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p x\u00f3a nh\u00f2a kho\u1ea3ng c\u00e1ch gi\u1eefa m\u1ed9t bu\u1ed5i live \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t s\u00f3ng chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p. B\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd c\u1ee7a n\u00f3, b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 n\u00e2ng cao ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o ra nh\u1eefng tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c s\u00e2u s\u1eafc h\u01a1n v\u1edbi kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3. H\u00e3y b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 v\u00e0 \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 n\u00e0y \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0a k\u00eanh TikTok c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n l\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ea7m cao m\u1edbi.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WGJ0dtjSFooikFx0XYilLst0g7g\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CWx3dhte4oVAuPxgR5tl9mEvglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"V0Kidqy2IocGzOxLzIxlADkBgoc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FnMpdlmeroUMmBxzO45lyb2Lg8f\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CiNPdL9yGogrOWx5SP9lClWZgQe\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXbIdAJxhoMK78xlitmlwna7gJi\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D4zHdkc9moG0p4xCDsMlPfuCgLg\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I1zOdpTlKoctbZx2CeclelbEgNe\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PLSVdBWXkoC8WCxZhallVoJrgfc\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Livestream tr\u00ean TikTok \u0111\u00e3 v\u01b0\u1ee3t qua gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i. \u0110\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng nhu c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, TikTok Live Studio \u0111\u00e3 ra \u0111\u1eddi, bi\u1ebfn m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t ph\u00f2ng thu ph\u00e1t s\u00f3ng th\u1ef1c th\u1ee5 v\u1edbi v\u00f4 v\u00e0n t\u00ednh n\u0103ng t\u00f9y bi\u1ebfn. Vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m ch\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5720,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[29,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5588","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-tiktok","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5588","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5588"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5588\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5694,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5588\/revisions\/5694"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5720"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5588"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=5588"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embedda